bluejetty:00154113:ios.description:
Elevate your device’s sound performance with precision-tuned audio solutions — right from your pocket! 
Why Choose the AI Speaker Cleaner: 
• Start using with just one click;
 • Answer a few simple questions to set up the right algorithm; 
• Use manual mode to generate any frequency; 
• Test the stereo compatibility of your device’s speakers; 
• Enjoy full support for iPhone and iPad — no limitations; 
• Set reminders so you never forget to care for your speakers;
 • Analyze processing stats by week, month, and year. 
Benefits of Using AI Speaker Cleaner for Your Device's Speakers: 
• Activates in seconds and requires no physical tools; 
• Non-invasive and compatible with most iPhones and iPads; 
• Generates a wide range of sound waves from 0Hz to 10,000Hz;
 • A handy, on-the-go solution for keeping your device in top shape. 
Warnings: 
• Use the app at your own risk — the developer is not responsible for any potential issues or damage that may occur from its use;
 • The app produces high-frequency or low-frequency sounds that may be startling or unpleasant in public settings; 
• Pets and animals may be sensitive to frequencies outside the human hearing range, use with caution; 
• Sudden loud sounds could startle young children or cause discomfort; 
• The app’s sounds may disturb others in public places such as libraries, offices, or public transport;
 • This app is not a substitute for professional diagnostics or repairs.
AI Speaker Cleaner is a free app designed to simplify daily audio tooling for your device’s speakers. 
Set up reminders to use it regularly and keep your device in great condition for years to come.
Test your device’s stereo compatibility by running the Stereo Test with various musical genres. 
Please note: The name 'AI Speaker Cleaner' refers to the app's focus on improving the user experience with device sound, not a physical cleaning process. 
It does not clean your device in the traditional sense, but instead helps you understand your speaker’s performance through audio tools.
 If you have suggestions for improving AI Speaker Cleaner, we’d love to hear from you! 
Your feedback and messages to our support team are invaluable in helping us make the app better.  
Contact us at helpmewithwave@gmail.com
 Keep your device in like-new condition with AI Speaker Cleaner! 
